Comment: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:45.86,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:12.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:11.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Ioryogi! Such a cute kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.95,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,I can no longer care for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.45,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Please take him home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you go causing trouble for people again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.73,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not even listening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:27.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't leave the kitty all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.80,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:38.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Now the kitty won't be lonely anymore and I can help find someone to take care of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:42.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you plan on living here for the rest of your life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:19.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A person who can't even look after herself plans on taking care of a cat. Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:24.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I couldn't just leave him there like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're taking in abandoned cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:34.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! It's just that the owner can't take care of him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:35.82,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:40.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't have the resolve to see it all the way through, don't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Good advice, doncha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:50.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:54.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He's probably hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.10,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.91,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What's the answer to number five?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:07.75,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, you don't know either?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.67,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:16.89,Default,C{I can't tell them apart -_-},0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.57,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:27.97,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We only have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:32.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But too many sweets will...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:32.87,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I mean! It's not for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:38.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's for the kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:41.21,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:44.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The owner can't take care of him anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:47.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and I was just wondering if there was anything I could get to feed him with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.35,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:53.05,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay if we go to your room, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.59,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like he likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.97,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:07.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Why are you two talking so quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:15.16,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Having pets in this apartment is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:20.95,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Someone living here before had a dog and the neighbors complained that he was too noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:26.45,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,So Mama won't take tenants with pets anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:31.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I can't keep him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:34.97,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think you could bring him back to his owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:42.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The kitty was just in a box by himself and I didn't see the owner's name anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:43.99,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:47.63,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,But sooner or later, the kitty will homeless again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:52.09,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if we could find someone who would take him in...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:58.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go to Yomogi Nursery and ask Miss Sayaka tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:02.55,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Miss Sayaka would say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:05.98,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,And if he's at Yomogi Nursery, we could go visit him any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:07.94,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Then we need to pick a name for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:09.70,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, did you have anything in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't just think of something on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.28,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,How about Milk since he's all white?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:26.55,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,And he seems to love milk too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:31.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk? What a cute name! That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.40,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:37.71,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,His fur's completely white!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.85,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,She said his name is Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.81,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Milk! Here kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:44.55,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna hold him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.94,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.36,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Lemme pet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.79,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like everyone likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then it would be okay for him to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.54,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Achoo! Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.21,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Come here for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:06.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru, you're allergic to cats, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:09.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Allergic... to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:12.05,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's means you get rashes or sneeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:14.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,or even worse, get an asthma attack when you come in contact with cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:22.34,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, keeping a cat at the nursery is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:24.57,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.11,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:32.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Your thoughtlessness causes trouble for the people around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not thoughtless!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then can you take responsibility yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.71,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:41.58,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just showing that you care about him for your own self-satisfaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.62,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,then you're the same as the owner who abandoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.84,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.91,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:55.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:07.22,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:11.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tickle me! I might look like a stuffed animal, but I'm not one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:13.79,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? So this is where you were hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:18.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:19.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.91,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:28.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, I'm sorry as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:32.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto didn't mean any harm either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:38.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I think he might've been projecting himself onto that kitten...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:42.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.98,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look for someone to take in the kitten too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:48.23,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure we'll be able to find someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:50.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:53.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what're you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to look for someone to take care of Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:59.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't continue causing trouble for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:00.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:03.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're causing me trouble too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:12.20,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.55,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Is Milk here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.16,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Allergic to cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.83,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:23.98,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:26.24,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we should ask Mama after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.73,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We can't! Pets are prohibited, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:31.33,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,If we ask, we'll cause problems for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.82,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:38.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone who would be willing to take care of this kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please become this kitty's owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:45.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of this{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:48.00,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho! Chise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:52.88,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Milk! Here kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:54.59,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Were you a good kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:58.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I asked Miss Sayaka, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.02,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We just came from the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:05.45,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:09.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I still haven't found anyone to take him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.33,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.65,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We'll definitely find someone for you, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:23.16,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I've already got my hands full taking care of all of the children...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.88,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Catherine, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.92,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, we should go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:33.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:39.58,Default,Angry man,0000,0000,0000,,You persistent salesman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.25,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.58,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Milk! Here kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.98,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.48,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Someone to take in that kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:25.98,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,I live by myself so I can't think of anyone off the top of my head, but I'll ask around too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'm causing trouble for everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.62,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think of it as trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:37.87,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're working so hard; it just makes us want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:42.99,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,It might be a good idea to stop going around knocking on strangers' doors though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:46.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto said
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:49.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,that if you're just showing that you care about him for your own self-satisfaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:50.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,then you're the same as the owner who abandoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.79,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Typical Fujimoto for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.13,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,You can't let him get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:11:00.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think anyone would want to abandon such a cute kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:04.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There must've been some sort of circumstance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:10.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But when Fujimoto said that... he seemed really lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:16.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But what he said was right. I can't do things half-heartedly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:19.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I need to do my best at everything I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:23.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go try knocking on the doors of the people I know this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:26.65,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,All right. If anything comes up, here's my cell phone number. Give me a call, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:30.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:43.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't look like anyone's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They're closed today...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:07.53,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,We deal with food products in the store, so keeping a cat's a little difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:12.31,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I can't help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.17,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? This is Mihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:22.63,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka? A kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:26.14,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could keep him here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.61,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Those children are working so hard too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:33.76,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:43.60,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten pretty dark out now, hasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:54.50,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Milk looks pretty worn out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:57.75,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's hungry, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.87,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:07.90,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:13.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do anything... how shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You can't even buy food for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.97,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Chise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:26.07,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:28.82,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I think we should go ask Mama after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:34.30,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure she would let us keep him. And then we can sleep with Milk tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.34,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.71,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you should stay with us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:38.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The lady from...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:45.08,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,If it isn't the beautiful songstress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.14,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:48.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How is the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:55.79,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,His mother is looking after him today because she has today off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:00.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:05.78,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that a young lady was trying to find a kitten a new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:11.66,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,It's this darling, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:14.79,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He's so little and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:19.61,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,If it's all right with you, I wonder if I could take him home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:21.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:23.34,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. I only have one grandchild,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:26.09,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,so it'd be wonderful if this kitten could become his playmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:34.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are people who sneeze and cough when they come in contact with cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:36.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Will the baby be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.56,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,The pizza deliveryman was worried about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Pizza deliveryman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:47.99,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He was going around asking everyone if they'd be willing to take in a kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:51.71,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I came over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:56.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:59.72,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,My grandson loves animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:02.08,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He isn't allergic to cats either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.42,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.80,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great, Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.42,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be alone anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:14.51,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be going then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:16.62,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye, Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.14,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We'll come visit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:20.85,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Grandma, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.49,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,This is food for Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.23,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. I'll be sure to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:31.88,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of Milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.16,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:48.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The room somehow feels bigger now that Milk isn't here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:52.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:57.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk's milk bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:02.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Chiho and Chise feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.66,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.45,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:15.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:17.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:22.00,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,If you're looking for Chiho and Chise, they're on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:31.03,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Milk's happy at his new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:33.97,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he is. That grandma seemed really nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:37.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Milk is in good hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:40.14,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.93,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:45.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to return this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:49.15,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Milk's milk bowl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:50.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:58.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's right... The night I met that grandma, there was a full moon just like there is tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:02.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There were beautiful cherry blossoms in bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:10.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The baby that she took out on a walk with her just wouldn't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:14.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to comfort him too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:18.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just made him cry harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:18.93,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:19.93,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:25.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And then... I sang a song for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:28.60,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,You sang, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:32.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. And then the baby stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:34.81,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of song was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.52,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:41.19,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.54,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Sing for us, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.24,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:08.13,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers that bloom in the spring
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:14.57,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and the endless sky of summertime
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:27.16,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,are both brilliantly engraved into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:40.74,Insert,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even when it rains and the windows are closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:33.09,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,This song...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:54.10,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,the overflowing light from my heart shines from above the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:19:08.39,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Guide me, O voice, so far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:12.18,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Like smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:15.32,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Like songs...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:21.25,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The resonating sound of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:28.00,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness or sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:34.47,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll embrace all of it and continue walking forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:38.38,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They're what make my hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:49.00,Insert,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,...strongly connect to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:24.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:27.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for helping Milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:35.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He has a very good owner now thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.56,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:39.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:48.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I remembered something important...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:51.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,May I please borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:55.46,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you hear of anyone who likes cats let me know, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:57.25,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.07,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.07,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:08.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.39,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.20,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:16.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We were able to find someone to take in the kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to let you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.45,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.45,0:21:22.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Fujimoto found someone for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:24.22,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.70,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:30.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for bothering you with all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:33.85,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't be. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:35.01,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.37,0:21:42.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:50.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto found a new owner for Milk... I wasn't able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.91,0:21:53.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You weren't able to help anyone, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:57.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You caused huge problems for everyone by bringing that cat home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:04.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... I caused so many people problems and worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:10.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's give-and-take. That's how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:15.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You noticed how upset Chiho and Chise were about having to give up the cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.89,0:22:17.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,and you sang for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:22.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I only wanted to tell them about the baby and his grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.35,0:22:25.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And it's that desire that allowed you to reassure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:30.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,People's hearts can also be healed by song, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.49,0:22:32.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:34.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Because of the wound on my ear...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:37.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Zero points, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.17,0:22:39.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ehh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:45.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But you know... It's so round, it looks just like the full moon tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.29,0:22:47.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't something to be happy about!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.12,0:22:50.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of perfect circles, Milk's milk bowl is also round like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:52.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We all match!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! If you like perfect circles so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:56.16,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,then you'll get a perfect zero on every assignment from here on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's so mean, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.20,Signs,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord1.5\fs23\c&H35393B&\fnHappy Hell\b1\3c&HEAEDED&\frz358.474\pos(632,157)}Arithmetic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.20,Signs,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord1.5\fscy140\fnCronos13B\3c&H293337&\c&H9B75DC&\frz6.147\pos(499,43)}Hanamaro
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.20,Signs,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord1.5\fscy140\fnCronos13B\c&H293337&\3c&HEAEDED&\frz351.623\pos(648,43)}Drill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.20,Signs,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs15\bord1.3\fnHarrowprint\3c&H4B4848&\frz19.021\pos(394,232)}I did\Nit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.20,Signs,Book,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs15\bord1.3\fnHarrowprint\3c&H4B4848&\frz349.078\pos(687,252)}So much\Nfun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:02.07,Signs,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\fnCorporate Rounded\pos(431,342)\frz14.692}Kiyokazu Fujimoto
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:35.23,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\bord2\fnHarrowprint\c&HBDC6CC&\3c&H172427&\move(359,74,359,104,0,2690)}Yomogi\NNursery
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.25,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0E3052&\pos(364,147)}Kudo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:47.47,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\bord2\c&H33658B&\3c&HC4D0DC&\fnSirona\t(\fscy117\fscx97)\move(360,68,360,72,0,1987)}European Style Sweets   {\c&H325C9A&}Tirol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:51.01,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.01,0:00:58.68,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:53.86,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:58.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:02.46,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.26,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:12.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:18.18,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:22.02,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:25.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:28.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:31.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:36.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:43.01,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.77,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:55.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:59.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:04.05,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.25,0:00:53.86,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.15,0:00:58.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.48,0:01:02.46,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.26,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.53,0:01:12.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.02,0:01:18.18,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.97,0:01:22.02,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.19,0:01:25.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.81,0:01:28.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.76,0:01:31.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.61,0:01:36.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Tell me,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.43,0:01:43.01,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.77,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.74,0:01:55.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.68,0:01:59.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.21,0:02:04.05,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I believe in tomorrow.
